OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 8, wowed by football shirt  
OL,4,Achallenge support during radiotherapy  
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old girl who set herself 
OL,7,Fa challenge to wear a different        
OL,8,Ffootball shirt every day of her        
OL,9,Ftreatment for a recurring brain tumour 
OL,10,Fsaid she was "overwhelmed" to receive  
OL,11,F150 signed shirts from some of the     
OL,12,Fworld's top players.                   
OL,14,FFootball-mad Lola, of Salford, aimed to
OL,15,Fget 30 shirts to wear during her       
OL,16,Fradiotherapy at The Christie hospital  
OL,17,Fin Manchester.                         
OL,19,FSince then, the likes of England and   
OL,20,FReal Madrid star Jude Bellingham and   
OL,21,FManchester City's Erling Haaland have  
OL,22,Fsent her shirts and personal messages. 
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
