OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 8, wowed by football shirt  
OL,4,Achallenge support during radiotherapy  
OL,6,FHaving finished the treatment, Lola is 
OL,7,Fnow auctioning them all off to raise   
OL,8,Fmoney for The Christie Charity and     
OL,9,FRoyal Manchester Children's Hospital as
OL,10,Fa thank you.                           
